THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE IN PSIPDF
==============================

psipdf.exe (PsiPDF's engine) is built from MuPDF 1.3 and the libraries
below, cut down (no JavaScript, CJK fonts, XPS, CBZ, forms, saving, JBIG2 or
JPEG 2000). PsiPDF.app and PsiPDF.mdl contain only PsiPDF's own code and
psion-core's.

